The Claude Code and Codex adapters of `@dsh-cove/dsh-web-all` speak those CLIs'
protocols from MIT-licensed reference implementations rather than from a
published specification: `@deepseek-ai/dsh-subagent-claude-code` and
`@deepseek-ai/dsh-subagent-codex`, both MIT, version 0.2.1-rc.5, as installed in
the `web` DSH profile under `~/.dsh/profiles/web/node_modules/`. The
external-session entry above records what was read from them and what was not
taken.

